    "updated_at": "2021-04-13T13:48:06Z",
    "body": "This looks reasonable to me. One tricky aspect might be the time coarsening. If the SW has the capability but we don't, we need to coarsen the SW times here. Otherwise they can be kept as-is.\r\n\r\n(That would be in line with what I suggested at https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/pull/1575#discussion_r610467138 so if that changes we'd need to adjust for that here too.)",
