    "created_at": "2021-11-08T09:09:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-11-08T09:09:40Z",
    "body": "As decided in the WG meeting, the info from the SW would remain opaque, but accessible from inside the service worker's performance timeline. The RT entry would stand for a particular `fetch` rather than a `response`.\r\n[This work](https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1329) is the first step to make this explicit.",
